  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "Chess Studio · Salud operativa",
  "uid": "chess-studio-api-overview",
  "version": 5,
  "weekStart": "monday",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "backend_service",
        "label": "Entorno",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "production : chess-studio-backend,staging : chess-studio-backend-staging",
        "current": {
          "text": "production",
          "value": "chess-studio-backend"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "chess-studio-backend|chess-studio-backend-staging",
        "multi": false,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Operación",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Estado a primera vista.** El bloque **OCI A1** muestra la salud real del host de staging (telemetría, CPU, RAM, red y disco) recogida por Alloy desde `/proc` y `/sys`; abre **Chess Studio · OCI host** para el detalle. Un `0` significa que la consulta respondió correctamente pero no hubo eventos en esa ventana; `No data` queda reservado para paneles donde la ausencia es semántica (logs/trazas) o para una señal que necesita diagnóstico. Si algo sale mal, abre **Chess Studio · Logs accionables** para 404/5xx/request_id y **Chess Studio · Trazas** para seguir latencia extremo a extremo. Deploy `${commit_sha}`."
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "P0 · OCI · coste mes",
      "description": "Coste real acumulado del mes consultado en OCI Usage API. La cifra puede llevar retraso de ingestión del proveedor; SIN DATOS durante >12 h es un fallo de observabilidad y debe investigarse.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "last_over_time(chess_studio_billing_cost_current_cycle{provider=\"oci\"}[12h])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{currency}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "SIN DATOS",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "P0 · Cloudflare · coste variable ciclo",
      "description": "Coste usage-based acumulado del ciclo desde Cloudflare Billing. No incluye cuotas fijas de planes/suscripciones. SIN DATOS durante >12 h es un fallo de observabilidad y debe investigarse.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "last_over_time(chess_studio_billing_cost_current_cycle{provider=\"cloudflare\"}[12h])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{currency}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "SIN DATOS",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "OCI A1 · telemetría",
      "description": "Estado de recepción de métricas del host A1. Si Alloy/node-exporter deja de reportar, la serie se vuelve stale y el panel pasa a SIN DATOS.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "max(node_uname_info{service_name=\"chess-studio-oci-host\",deployment_environment=\"staging\"})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "SIN DATOS",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "OCI A1 · CPU",
      "description": "CPU ocupada media del host durante 5 minutos.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "100 - (avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{service_name=\"chess-studio-oci-host\",deployment_environment=\"staging\",mode=\"idle\"}[5m])) * 100)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "noValue": "SIN DATOS",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "title": "OCI A1 · RAM",
      "description": "Porcentaje de RAM usada calculado con MemAvailable/MemTotal.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 9,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (1 - (avg(node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{service_name=\"chess-studio-oci-host\",deployment_environment=\"staging\"}) / avg(node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{service_name=\"chess-studio-oci-host\",deployment_environment=\"staging\"})))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "noValue": "SIN DATOS",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 75
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "title": "OCI A1 · red",
      "description": "Tráfico agregado RX+TX del host durante 5 minutos. El dashboard OCI host separa ambos sentidos.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 14,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total{service_name=\"chess-studio-oci-host\",deployment_environment=\"staging\",device!=\"lo\"}[5m])) + sum(rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{service_name=\"chess-studio-oci-host\",deployment_environment=\"staging\",device!=\"lo\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "SIN DATOS"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "title": "OCI A1 · disco",
      "description": "I/O agregado de lectura+escritura del host durante 5 minutos. El dashboard OCI host separa ambos sentidos.",
      "type": "stat",
